Data is not covered by this licence.

The MIT licence above covers the source code: everything in this repository
except the data files under app/public/ (the baked datasets, images and
textures) and the screenshots under docs/images/ insofar as they show those
data. Each dataset keeps the licence its publisher gave it - public domain,
CC0, CC BY, CC BY-SA, ODbL, non-commercial terms, or citation only - and its
attribution must be kept when it is reused. docs/DATA-SOURCES.md lists every
source, its licence and the attribution it asks for; the app shows the same
list under Layers -> Data credits.
